@startuml 协同过滤推荐时序图

skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #e2f0ff
skinparam noteBorderColor #2d8cf0

actor 用户
participant "推荐界面" as UI
participant "RecommendController" as Controller
participant "RecommendService" as Service
database "OrderMapper" as OrderMapper
database "BookMapper" as BookMapper

用户 -> UI: 点击协同过滤推荐
activate UI
UI -> Controller: GET /recommend/collaborative
activate Controller
Controller -> Service: recommendByCollaborative(userId, 10)
activate Service

Service -> OrderMapper: selectAll()
activate OrderMapper
OrderMapper --> Service: 所有订单
deactivate OrderMapper

Service -> Service: 构建用户-图书矩阵
Service -> Service: 获取当前用户购买的图书

alt 当前用户无购买
    Service -> Service: 调用热门推荐
    Service -> BookMapper: selectAll()
    activate BookMapper
    BookMapper --> Service: 所有图书
    deactivate BookMapper
    Service -> Service: 按销量排序
else 有购买数据
    Service -> Service: 遍历其他用户
    loop 每个其他用户
        Service -> Service: 计算Jaccard相似度
    end
    
    Service -> Service: 按相似度排序用户
    Service -> Service: 取最相似的K个用户
    
    Service -> Service: 收集相似用户购买的图书
    Service -> Service: 过滤当前用户已购买的
    Service -> Service: 按权重排序图书
    
    Service -> BookMapper: selectById(bookId)
    activate BookMapper
    BookMapper --> Service: 图书信息
    deactivate BookMapper
end

Service --> Controller: 返回推荐列表
deactivate Service

Controller --> UI: 返回JSON数据
UI -> UI: 渲染推荐列表
UI --> 用户: 显示推荐图书

deactivate Controller
deactivate UI

@enduml
